# ==========================================
# KhelaDekho Worker Configuration
# ==========================================
# These variables are set in wrangler.toml or Cloudflare Dashboard
# V1_HOME_URL — Upstream scraper for V1 channels
# V2_HOME_URL — Upstream scraper for V2 channels
# V4_HOME_URL — Upstream scraper for V4 channels
# XKEY — API key required by all endpoints for authentication
# Must match XKEY in KhelaDekho-Frontend/.env.example
# Generate one: openssl rand -hex 32 (or any random string)
# Set via Cloudflare Dashboard or `wrangler secret put XKEY` (not in wrangler.toml)
